[TEST]
UID: APLLSR-009-T01
TITLE: No Audio Track Detection
TEST_TYPE: Robustness
TEST_LEVEL: Integration
PRECONDITIONS: A valid media file containing no audio tracks is available.
INPUTS: An audio stream containing no audio tracks.
PROCEDURE: >>>
1. Supply the input stream to the audio identification subsystem.
2. Execute the identification procedure.
3. Examine the returned error.
